  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Add all ingredients to blender. Start with eggs and water and cream cheese so you don't have anything get stuck at bottom.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend until smooth, scraping down the sides if needed. Let batter sit for 2 minutes.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a non-stick skillet to medium heat. For each pancake, pour 3 to 4 tablespoons of batter onto skillet.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Once you start to see little bubbles form, flip and continue to cook until pancake is browned on each side. Continue until you have used all pancake batter.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve pancakes topped with butter and syrup!",
      "group": null
    }
